  "subtitle": "Capture allergen source, exposure route, current plan, and emergency supply; confirm symptom threshold and guardian update.",
  "description": "Allergy Action Plan records allergen source, exposure route, current plan, emergency supply, symptom threshold, and guardian update. Allergy Action Plan evidence stays linked.",
  "use_case": "Use this allergy action plan authorization decision when staff must document allergen source and exposure route. Reconcile current plan, emergency supply, symptom threshold, and guardian update before the allergy action plan handoff. Use the current clinician action-plan reference, allergen list, medication-label match, emergency-supply seal and expiration, exposure record, and guardian receipt. Unlike a medication administration record, this plan centers exposure prevention, recognized threshold signs, emergency-supply access, school response roles, and return to review. Ask the assigned allergy action plan reviewer to confirm allergen source against the organization's policy.",
  "risk_tier": "C",
